{"title":"Combined feed","url":"https://Vinnl.github.io/feeds/all.xml","elements":[{"title":"part of a Falcon 9 rocket recently collided with the Moon (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_SpaceX_lunar_impact\" title=\"2026 SpaceX lunar impact\">part of a Falcon 9 rocket recently collided with the Moon</a></b>, making a new crater <i>(pictured)</i><span style=\"padding-left:0.15em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">?</span></span>","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_SpaceX_lunar_impact","retrieved":1787594305032},{"title":"Margaret and Roumania Peters (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that decades before Venus and Serena Williams, tennis players <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Margaret_and_Roumania_Peters\" title=\"Margaret and Roumania Peters\">Margaret and Roumania Peters</a></b> were \"tennis's original sister act\"?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Margaret_and_Roumania_Peters","retrieved":1787594305034},{"title":"assassination of Patrice Lumumba (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that it took Belgium 41 years to apologize for the <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Assassination_of_Patrice_Lumumba\" title=\"Assassination of Patrice Lumumba\">assassination of Patrice Lumumba</a></b>, and then another 20 years to return his tooth?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Assassination_of_Patrice_Lumumba","retrieved":1787594305036},{"title":"The Blues (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that Randy Newman's song \"<b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Blues_(Randy_Newman_song)\" title=\"The Blues (Randy Newman song)\">The Blues</a></b>\" has been interpreted as a parody of Paul Simon's work, but Simon provided some of the vocals?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Blues_(Randy_Newman_song)","retrieved":1787594305037},{"title":"Old North Church (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that Boston's <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Old_North_Church\" title=\"Old North Church\">Old North Church</a></b> lacked the space for a graveyard, so 1,100 people were entombed under it instead?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Old_North_Church","retrieved":1787594305042},{"title":"The Rise and Reign of the Mammals (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that, in <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stephen_L._Brusatte\" title=\"Stephen L. Brusatte\">Steve Brusatte</a>'s book <i><b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Rise_and_Reign_of_the_Mammals\" title=\"The Rise and Reign of the Mammals\">The Rise and Reign of the Mammals</a></b></i>, humans are given \"about the same attention as horses and whales and elephants\"?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Rise_and_Reign_of_the_Mammals","retrieved":1787594305044},{"title":"have scored more than 100 goals in a calendar year (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that Toluca FC is the only team in Liga MX to <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Toluca_FC_records_and_statistics\" title=\"List of Toluca FC records and statistics\">have scored more than 100 goals in a calendar year</a></b>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Toluca_FC_records_and_statistics","retrieved":1787594305044},{"title":"Industrial Arbitration Court (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Industrial_Arbitration_Court\" title=\"Industrial Arbitration Court\">Industrial Arbitration Court</a></b> made it mandatory in 1993 for all collective agreements to be submitted on a 5.25-inch (130<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">&nbsp;</span>mm) floppy disk?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Industrial_Arbitration_Court","retrieved":1787594305045},{"title":"Lake Flixton (Wikipedia — did you know?)","conte